<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLAND BEAT POLAND 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLAND BEAT POLAND 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>England beat Poland 2-1 (halftime</p>
<p>2-1) in a World Cup European group two soccer qualifier at</p>
<p>Wembley on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>England - Alan Shearer (24th, 37th mins)</p>
<p>Poland - Marek Citko (6th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 74,663</p>
<p>Group two standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> England		2   2   0   0   5   1    6</p>
<p> Italy		  2   2   0   0   4   1    6</p>
<p> Poland		 1   0   0   1   1   2    0</p>
<p> Georgia		1   0   0   1   0   1    0</p>
<p> Moldova		2   0   0   2   1   6    0</p>
<p>Next matches: Nov 9 Georgia v England, Nov 10 Poland v</p>
<p>Moldova</p>
</text>
